#: foldav/linux/data/dev.aperte.Foldav.metainfo.xml:10
msgid ""
"Foldav is a file manager for the files in your Nextcloud: folders are "
"copied, moved and deleted on the server in one request, not file by file."
msgstr ""

#: foldav/linux/data/dev.aperte.Foldav.metainfo.xml:15
msgid ""
"Connects through GNOME Online Accounts or a browser sign-in, to more than "
"one account"
msgstr ""

#: foldav/linux/data/dev.aperte.Foldav.metainfo.xml:16
msgid "Opens files in their apps and sends back what you save"
msgstr ""

#: foldav/linux/data/dev.aperte.Foldav.metainfo.xml:17
msgid ""
"Uploads and downloads files and folders, with drag and drop to and from Files"
msgstr ""

#: foldav/linux/data/dev.aperte.Foldav.metainfo.xml:18
msgid ""
"Shows the trash bin, recent and starred files, thumbnails and search by name"
msgstr ""

#: foldav/linux/data/dev.aperte.Foldav.metainfo.xml:19
msgid "Shares by link or with users, and keeps versions and tags"
msgstr ""
